{"version":1,"content":"<p>男神吳彥祖與名模太太Lisa S.結婚十多年，育有愛女吳斐然（Raven），一家三口近年定居美國生活。</p><p>向來熱愛策騎的Lisa S.，日前在社交平台上載駕車前往馬場的日常短片，卻一反平日優雅大方的形象，因受不了當地嚴重塞車而罕見當場發火。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T08:23:54.939237+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T08:01:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T08:17:13.600703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T08:17:13.600703+00:00","content_hash":"b2fd81663d70e0655032feddb23383bbdf282bb7f5d9906ca7b3297132cd51b4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}